[["Map",1,2,70,71,78,79],"blog",["Map",3,4,35,36],"first-post",{"id":3,"data":5,"body":15,"filePath":16,"digest":17,"rendered":18},{"title":6,"description":7,"date":8,"tags":9,"category":10,"theme":13,"draft":14},"Building a Local AI Agent","How I built a local AI agent using Python and open-source models",["Date","2026-07-29T00:00:00.000Z"],[10,11,12],"AI","Python","Local AI","ai",true,"## Why Local AI?\n\nRunning AI models locally gives you full control over your data and workflow.\n\n```python\nfrom transformers import pipeline\n\nclassifier = pipeline(\"text-classification\")\nresult = classifier(\"This is amazing!\")\nprint(result)\n```\n\n### Key Benefits\n\n- Privacy - your data stays on your machine\n- No API costs after initial setup\n- Full customization of models and parameters\n- Offline capability\n\nThe future of AI is local, private, and personalized.","src/content/blog/first-post.md","4b20f8f42c40beec",{"html":19,"metadata":20},"\u003Ch2 id=\"why-local-ai\">Why Local AI?\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Running AI models locally gives you full control over your data and workflow.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"expressive-code\">\u003Clink rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_astro/ec.t05yi.css\">\u003Cscript type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/ec.0vx5m.js\">\u003C/script>\u003Cfigure class=\"frame\">\u003Cfigcaption class=\"header\">\u003C/figcaption>\u003Cpre data-language=\"python\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#F97583;--1:#BF3441\">from\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#E1E4E8;--1:#24292E\"> transformers \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#F97583;--1:#BF3441\">import\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#E1E4E8;--1:#24292E\"> pipeline\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\n\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#E1E4E8;--1:#24292E\">classifier \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#F97583;--1:#BF3441\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#E1E4E8;--1:#24292E\"> pipeline(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#9ECBFF;--1:#032F62\">\"text-classification\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#E1E4E8;--1:#24292E\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#E1E4E8;--1:#24292E\">result \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#F97583;--1:#BF3441\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#E1E4E8;--1:#24292E\"> classifier(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#9ECBFF;--1:#032F62\">\"This is amazing!\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#E1E4E8;--1:#24292E\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#79B8FF;--1:#005CC5\">print\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#E1E4E8;--1:#24292E\">(result)\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cdiv class=\"copy\">\u003Cdiv aria-live=\"polite\">\u003C/div>\u003Cbutton title=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-copied=\"Copied!\" data-code=\"from transformers import pipelineclassifier = pipeline(&#x22;text-classification&#x22;)result = classifier(&#x22;This is amazing!&#x22;)print(result)\">\u003Cdiv>\u003C/div>\u003C/button>\u003C/div>\u003C/figure>\u003C/div>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"key-benefits\">Key Benefits\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Privacy - your data stays on your machine\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>No API costs after initial setup\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Full customization of models and parameters\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Offline capability\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>The future of AI is local, private, and personalized.\u003C/p>",{"headings":21,"localImagePaths":30,"remoteImagePaths":31,"frontmatter":32,"imagePaths":34},[22,26],{"depth":23,"slug":24,"text":25},2,"why-local-ai","Why Local AI?",{"depth":27,"slug":28,"text":29},3,"key-benefits","Key Benefits",[],[],{"title":6,"description":7,"date":8,"tags":33,"category":10,"theme":13,"draft":14},[10,11,12],[],"math-in-markdown",{"id":35,"data":37,"body":46,"filePath":47,"digest":48,"rendered":49},{"title":38,"description":39,"date":40,"tags":41,"category":42,"theme":44,"draft":45},"Beautiful Math in Markdown","Using KaTeX to render mathematical expressions in your blog posts",["Date","2026-07-28T00:00:00.000Z"],[42,43],"Math","Markdown","math",false,"## Inline Math\n\nEinstein's famous equation: $E = mc^2$\n\n## Display Math\n\n$$\n\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{n^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}{6}\n$$\n\n## The Quadratic Formula\n\nFor a quadratic equation $ax^2 + bx + c = 0$, the solutions are:\n\n$$\nx = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}\n$$\n\n## Matrix Notation\n\n$$\n\\begin{pmatrix}\na & b \\\\\nc & d\n\\end{pmatrix}\n$$\n\nMath renders beautifully with KaTeX right in your markdown.","src/content/blog/math-in-markdown.md","6eb59198c7b79c13",{"html":50,"metadata":51},"\u003Ch2 id=\"inline-math\">Inline Math\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Einstein’s famous equation: \u003Cspan class=\"katex\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-mathml\">\u003Cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\u003Csemantics>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmi>E\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>=\u003C/mo>\u003Cmi>m\u003C/mi>\u003Cmsup>\u003Cmi>c\u003C/mi>\u003Cmn>2\u003C/mn>\u003C/msup>\u003C/mrow>\u003Cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = mc^2\u003C/annotation>\u003C/semantics>\u003C/math>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cspan class=\"base\">\u003Cspan class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mrel\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"base\">\u003Cspan class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">m\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">c\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"msupsub\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-t\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\">\u003Cspan style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mtight\">2\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"display-math\">Display Math\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cspan class=\"katex-display\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-mathml\">\u003Cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\u003Csemantics>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmunderover>\u003Cmo>∑\u003C/mo>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmi>n\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>=\u003C/mo>\u003Cmn>1\u003C/mn>\u003C/mrow>\u003Cmi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞\u003C/mi>\u003C/munderover>\u003Cmfrac>\u003Cmn>1\u003C/mn>\u003Cmsup>\u003Cmi>n\u003C/mi>\u003Cmn>2\u003C/mn>\u003C/msup>\u003C/mfrac>\u003Cmo>=\u003C/mo>\u003Cmfrac>\u003Cmsup>\u003Cmi>π\u003C/mi>\u003Cmn>2\u003C/mn>\u003C/msup>\u003Cmn>6\u003C/mn>\u003C/mfrac>\u003C/mrow>\u003Cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{n^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}{6}\u003C/annotation>\u003C/semantics>\u003C/math>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cspan class=\"base\">\u003Cspan class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mop op-limits\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\">\u003Cspan style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mtight\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mrel mtight\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mtight\">1\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"top:-3.05em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mtight\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mtight\">∞\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-s\">​\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\">\u003Cspan>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">\u003Cspan class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mfrac\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\">\u003Cspan style=\"top:-2.314em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">n\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"msupsub\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-t\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\">\u003Cspan style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mtight\">2\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"top:-3.23em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"top:-3.677em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">1\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-s\">​\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\">\u003Cspan>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mrel\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"base\">\u003Cspan class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">\u003Cspan class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mfrac\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\">\u003Cspan style=\"top:-2.314em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">6\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"top:-3.23em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"top:-3.677em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"msupsub\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-t\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\">\u003Cspan style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mtight\">2\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-s\">​\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\">\u003Cspan>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quadratic-formula\">The Quadratic Formula\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>For a quadratic equation \u003Cspan class=\"katex\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-mathml\">\u003Cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\u003Csemantics>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmi>a\u003C/mi>\u003Cmsup>\u003Cmi>x\u003C/mi>\u003Cmn>2\u003C/mn>\u003C/msup>\u003Cmo>+\u003C/mo>\u003Cmi>b\u003C/mi>\u003Cmi>x\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>+\u003C/mo>\u003Cmi>c\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>=\u003C/mo>\u003Cmn>0\u003C/mn>\u003C/mrow>\u003Cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ax^2 + bx + c = 0\u003C/annotation>\u003C/semantics>\u003C/math>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cspan class=\"base\">\u003Cspan class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">a\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">x\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"msupsub\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-t\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\">\u003Cspan style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mtight\">2\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mbin\">+\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"base\">\u003Cspan class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">b\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">x\u003C/span>\u003C